## Reading heuristics
- `work_summary` = the main work the user was driving, not a generic topic label.
- `session_takeaway` = one concise replayable summary of what happened and where it landed.
- `resistance_summary` should name the main drag pattern, not list every issue.
- Use `method_guided` only when the session clearly followed an explicit framework or staged method.
- Use `capability_focus` only when the session was creating reusable AI working methods or AI-native assets, not merely using them.
- Keep resistance / momentum items only when confidence >= 70.

